The first-generation Volvo S60 is known for its comfortable ride and five-cylinder engines. Fuel use depends on the engine, journey, weather and maintenance.

## Official and real-world figures

Official figures come from standardised tests. Short trips, cold starts, traffic and tyre pressure can all affect the numbers you see yourself.

The comparison tables on this preview website use sample data. They are not published measurements from real Revly participants.

## Track your own fill-ups

Record full fill-ups and mileage to calculate your own consumption. Comparing several comparable journeys is more useful than judging a single trip.

[Explore the sample model comparison](/en/verbruik/volvo/s60-2-4/).
